00:08:42,000 --> 00:08:48,000
Saturn 3 is a science fiction, thriller film directed by Stanley Donen.

3
00:13:03,000 --> 00:13:09,000
In the future, Earth is overcrowded and the
population relies on distant bases to be fed.

4
00:17:24,000 --> 00:17:30,000
In the Saturn 3 station, Major Adam and the scientist Alex, who is also his lover and has never been on
Earth, have been researching hydroponics for three years in the base alone with their dog Sally.

5
00:21:45,000 --> 00:21:51,000
Captain Benson arrives Saturn 3 with Hector, incapable to controlling his
emotions he transfers his homicidal tendency and insanity to Hector.

6
00:26:06,000 --> 00:26:12,000
Now Major Adam and Alex are trapped in the station
with a dangerous psychopath robot.

7
00:30:27,000 --> 00:30:33,000
Alex, played by Farrah Fawcett-Majors.

8
00:34:48,000 --> 00:34:54,000
Major Adam, played by Kirk Douglas.

9
00:39:09,000 --> 00:39:15,000
Benson, played by Harvey Keitel.

10
00:43:30,000 --> 00:43:36,000
Harding (uncredited), played by Ed Bishop.

11
