13
00:56:33,000 --> 00:56:39,000
Saturn 3 is a 1980 British science fiction film produced and directed by Stanley
Donen, starring Farrah Fawcett, Kirk Douglas and Harvey Keitel.

14
01:00:54,000 --> 01:01:00,000
The screenplay was written by Martin Amis, from a story by John Barry.

15
01:05:15,000 --> 01:05:21,000
Though a British production, made by Lew Grade's ITC Entertainment and shot at
Shepperton Studios, the film has an American cast and director.

16
01:09:36,000 --> 01:09:42,000
Saturn 3 was a box office bomb and earned largely negative reviews.

17
01:13:57,000 --> 01:14:03,000
Keitel's biographer called the film the "nadir of his career".

18
01:18:18,000 --> 01:18:24,000
The film explores themes of spacecraft, moon, chess, tattoo, cyborg.

19
01:22:39,000 --> 01:22:45,000
The tone is thought_provoking and intense.
